Algorithm TwoSumIndices(arr, target):
    Initialize an empty hash map called indexMap
    
    For i from 0 to length of arr - 1:
        Set currentNumber = arr[i]
        Set complement = target - currentNumber
        
        If complement is in indexMap:
            Return [indexMap[complement], i]
        
        Put (currentNumber, i) into indexMap
    
    Return Null (or throw error if no solution)

Main Function:
    Input array = [2, 7, 11, 15]
    Input target = 9
    
    result = TwoSumIndices(array, target)
    Print result